# Production backup on deploy (mandatory when DB risk)

**Trigger with:** `deploy`, `release`, `push to live` (same as `deployment-process.mdc`).

## When backup is required (agent must take it — do not only ask the user)

Take a **fresh production PostgreSQL backup yourself** before tagging if **any** of these are true:

- New Alembic revisions since the live `alembic current` (migrations will run on deploy)
- Schema drops/renames, data backfills, irreversible migrations, or restore-risk changes
- User says backup / data-loss risk is a concern
- Live Alembic / image tag is **behind** the release and the gap includes migrations

If backup **fails**, hard-stop. Do not tag or SSH-deploy until a successful dump exists.

If the release has **no** new migrations vs live and no data-risk, backup is optional; still preferred before major releases.

## Reuse known live-server facts (do not rediscover every time)

Verified in prior Cursor live deploys (BatchMode SSH from this workstation):

| Fact | Value |
|------|--------|
| SSH | `ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=20 root@188.245.156.127` |
| App path | `/home/primeadmin/p7erp_local` |
| Operator | run deploy/backup as `primeadmin` via `sudo -u primeadmin -H bash -lc '...'` |
| Compose | `docker-compose.prod.yml` |
| Site | https://prime7erp.com |
| Images | `prime7biz/p7erp-backend` / `prime7biz/p7erp-frontend` |

Never put passwords, `.env` secrets, or private keys in rules or chat commits. Prefer existing SSH key + BatchMode.

## Backup command (run before tag when required)

```bash
ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=20 root@188.245.156.127 \
  "sudo -u primeadmin -H bash -lc 'cd /home/primeadmin/p7erp_local && COMPOSE_FILE=docker-compose.prod.yml bash scripts/db_backup.sh'"
```

Confirm success: new `backups/db/p7erp_*.dump` + matching `.sha256`, script exit 0. Report path/size in the deploy report.

Optional (runbook): `BACKUP_DIR=/var/backups/p7erp` if that host path is configured; otherwise default `./backups/db` under the app path is fine (used successfully on prior releases).

Docs: `docs/erp-modernization/BACKUP_RESTORE_RUNBOOK.md`, `scripts/db_backup.sh`.

## Live deploy command (after tag images are built)

```bash
ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=20 root@188.245.156.127 \
  "sudo -u primeadmin -H bash -lc 'cd /home/primeadmin/p7erp_local && git pull --ff-only origin main && DEPLOY_PATH=/home/primeadmin/p7erp_local bash scripts/deploy_production_remote.sh vX.Y.Z'"
```

## Read-only pre-check (optional but useful)

```bash
ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=20 root@188.245.156.127 \
  "cd /home/primeadmin/p7erp_local; grep -E '^(BACKEND_IMAGE|FRONTEND_IMAGE)=' .env; docker compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml exec -T backend alembic current 2>/dev/null | tail -1"
```
